  "chapters": [
    {
      "label": "Notice the hurt",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 10.6,
      "text": "Hey, friends. Our time together is too precious to spend making someone feel small. Making fun of someone can hurt, even when we call it a joke.",
      "source": "audio/dino_fenrir_michael_70_30-1.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "2a04ac00a82c09c121d8249b49d45d2b3d71501739a27a1d9530f24d662895c2",
      "pcmSampleStart": 9600,
      "pcmSamples": 244800
    },
    {
      "label": "Choose what comes next",
      "start": 11.0,
      "end": 18.25,
      "text": "If someone feels hurt, let's stop and listen. We all make mistakes. What matters is what we choose next.",
      "source": "audio/dino_fenrir_michael_70_30-2.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "09f7f4468c313d9883d77c46a89d809446ae87dc79f4774d1b8c9503647b7b14",
      "pcmSampleStart": 264000,
      "pcmSamples": 174000
    },
    {
      "label": "Make room for everyone",
      "start": 18.65,
      "end": 29.9,
      "text": "We can say sorry, make things right, and help someone feel included. It's never too late to choose kindness. You matter. They matter too. Let's make room for everyone.",
      "source": "audio/dino_fenrir_michael_70_30-3.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "15892b07c5bbed0c22ce72cd6c14676c5982468ef94238cf6275d905d98cd48c",
      "pcmSampleStart": 447600,
      "pcmSamples": 270000
    }
  ],
